{"bbox": [106.89048580737038, 532.7049424333316, 460.6728007859734, 577.3369781507188], "text": "We live in India and work for India . But we should not forget that we belong to the larger family of the world . The people living in other countries are after all our cousins . It would be such an excellent thing if all the people in the world were happy and contend .", "page_number": 6}
